{"seq":3,"slug":"six-practices-and-spirit","title":"六项精进与斗魂","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/six-practices-and-spirit","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-six-endeavors","title":"六项精进","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/six-practices-and-spirit/the-six-endeavors","wordCount":1581,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"burning-fighting-spirit","title":"燃烧的斗魂","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/six-practices-and-spirit/burning-fighting-spirit","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 六项精进与斗魂\n\n本章阐述稻盛和夫\"六项精进\"与\"燃烧的斗魂\"的修行之道。六项精进，是提升心性、做好工作与人生的六条根本准则；燃烧的斗魂，则是经营所需的顽强斗志与不屈意志。两篇文档，分别阐述六项精进的准则，以及燃烧斗魂的精神。\n"}